### 2.4 simple string message
POST http://localhost:8080/send?message=Hello

### 3 structured JSON message
POST http://localhost:8080/sendStructured?message=Hello%20Again

### 5 transaction: success, both messages arrive
POST http://localhost:8080/sendTransactional?first=one&second=two

### 5 transaction: failure between the sends, no message arrives
POST http://localhost:8080/sendTransactional?first=lost-one&second=lost-two&fail=true
